  "titleText": {
    "es": "—¿Te recojo a las ocho? —A las nueve. Tengo que volver a minar el camino de entrada.",
    "en": "'Pick you up at eight?' 'Nine.  I've got to re-mine the driveway.'",
    "noteEn": "The official title text continues the pair's mutual booby-trapping joke: the pickup time must allow the driveway to be mined again. The Spanish archive uses the same joke with volver a minar."
  },
